note right of Invoice
  Cálculos (TaxRates vigentes a issuedOn):
  amounts = TaxBreakdown.fromTaxableBase(base, IGV 18%)
  retention = total x 3%              (si hasRetention)
  detraction = ROUND(total x 12%, 0)  (si hasDetraction)
  netAmount = total - retention - detraction
  collectedAmount = suma(payments.amount)
  outstandingBalance = total - collectedAmount
  status:
  - COLLECTED si outstandingBalance <= 0
  - PARTIALLY_COLLECTED si 0 < collected < total
  (el Excel mezclaba "=0" y "<=0")
  Invariantes: número (serie + correlativo) único;
  no se cobra más que outstandingBalance;
  voidInvoice() solo sin pagos.
end note

note right of InvoicePayment
  DETRACTION_DEPOSIT -> cuenta tipo DETRACTIONS
  (Banco de la Nación); NET_DEPOSIT -> CHECKING.
  Validado con TreasuryContextFacade.
  selfDetraction: la empresa deposita la detracción
  (treasury crea un Payable al escuchar InvoiceIssuedEvent).
end note

note bottom
  The REST controllers delegate invoicing, collections and scheduled collections to
  application services. Invoice is the aggregate root of its payments and registers
  domain events that treasury (cash movements) and accounting (journal entries) consume.
  ScheduledCollection models the "ventas proyectadas" of the cash flow and is marked
  as realized when the real invoice is issued.
end note
@enduml
